  "identifier": "weasis",
  "name": "Weasis",
  "description": "Comprehensive open-source DICOM viewer available as a desktop application and web-based deployment. Supports the full DICOM stack: 2D/3D image viewing, multiplanar reconstruction, volume rendering, structured reports, DICOM ECG waveform display and measurement, radiotherapy structures and dose (DVH), and SUV calculations. Integrates with PACS systems via DICOMweb and WADO. Dual-licensed EPL-2.0 and Apache-2.0. Maintained by Nicolas Roduit; used in hospital and research deployments as a lightweight alternative to commercial PACS viewers.",
  "url": "https://nroduit.github.io/en/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/nroduit/Weasis",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "version": "4.6.6",
  "dateModified": "2025-12-29",
