  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most widely used open-source desktop DICOM viewer — fills the gap left by OHIF Viewers (web-only). Dual-licensed EPL-2.0/Apache-2.0, 1.3k stars, actively maintained (v4.6.6, December 2025). Assess rather than Adopt due to individual governance (single maintainer) and the EPL-2.0 component which requires attention in commercial contexts. Strong choice for institutions needing a deployable desktop or web DICOM viewer without a commercial PACS licence.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-22",
